      "cooked": "<p>I figure that our shared love of superheros and games means that there have to be some&nbsp;<span>Overwatch players on the forum. Right?</span></p><p><span>I'll admit that I'm not much of gamer, I got sucked into Overwatch through Blizzard's amazing animated shorts that featured the background lore of the characters.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>I've been playing for a couple of months now and would love to group up with other Sentinels fans.&nbsp;</span><span>I play on Xbox under the name \"ThatLever\" if you want to find me.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
