      "created_at": "2017-11-29T15:41:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For anyone who hasn't seen them, the Overwatch animated shorts and the game's cinematic trailer can be found at:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://playoverwatch.com/en-us/media/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://playoverwatch.com/en-us/media/</a></p><p>They're surprisingly fun and really build up a lot of background lore for a superhero shoot 'em up.&nbsp; It triggers the same thing that the color text on the SotM cards does for me.&nbsp; Sentinels is a fun game by itself, but it's the lore behind the game and the relationships of the characters that makes it come alive.</p>",
