      "created_at": "2018-03-19T04:20:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’ve been called out before while playing with friends on TTS. &nbsp;Something about calling that one Fanatic card that deals damage equal to her max-curent HP her “ultimate.” &nbsp;Then (because we were playing with Cauldron) making a High Noon joke when I kept giving extra powers to 1929 Tango (whose power deals 3 damage at the start of her next turn, for those not aware- the guy playing her was spreading them out against Dreamer so he was going to kill like 3 projections).</p><p>AU where Lucio is Virtuoso of the Void.</p><p>EDIT: Btw my battletag is CapnMunch #1487, and it’s a lot easier to aim with Expatriette than it is with Soldier.</p>",
